		bool ownFlash = false;   // (2026-11-13 PTFlashOwnPixels) this camera ray: the game's own pixel + the flashlight's light on the traced surface there
		gGeoSplit = false;   // (2026-11-12 ptbump) set again below where this hit's shading normal is bumped
