		// alpha (1 written; with the game's MSAA the written share of the samples). Green: 0.5 a screen surface, 1 recorded grass, 0 none
		// (the game's own pixel or a traced hit). Blue: the prep pass's code: 1 the mask (water, grass without records), 0.75 a sure mark,
